# Force LF on checkout. GitHub Windows runners (and default Git-for-Windows
# clones) set core.autocrlf=true, which smudges LF blobs to CRLF on checkout
# and breaks `biome check` (formatter lineEnding=lf) in CI. The eol attribute
# takes precedence over core.autocrlf, so text files always check out as LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
